      "content": "\"defining economic opportunity\" sounds a bit optimistic tbh. what about the actual nuts and bolts? like the grid stability issues and the massive shortage of minerals needed for batteries/turbines? seems like a lot of people are glossing over those technical and cost hurdles.",
